- **Breaking change:** Fleet ignores the `FLEET_JIT_USER_ROLE_TEAM_<FLEET_ID>` SAML attribute. Rename it to `FLEET_JIT_USER_ROLE_FLEET_<FLEET_ID>` in your identity provider before upgrading. Until you do, a new user whose fleet roles come only from the old attribute is created as a global observer. An existing user whose login response has only old attributes keeps their current roles, and one whose response mixes old and new attributes loses the fleets sent only through the old attribute.
